  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatambuli hadi anyana kaIsarela mana kweyi Aroni nawanyanindi amayala, wakayishikŋi kwakwihi naneyi, kulonda akankalakeli mudimu wawupristu, diwu aAroni naNadabi naAbihu, ni aEleyazari naItamari, wowanyana kaAroni amayala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamuchimini mana kweyi Aroni yuma yakuvwala yajila yakulema nalubanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakahoshi nawantu ejima akweti maana munyi chima yawu, inenzeshi naspiritu yama ana, kulonda akachimi yuma yaAroni yakuvwala yakumujilika nachu, kulonda akankalakeli mudimu wawupristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya yuma yakuvwala yakachimawu; nichibwiku chakuvwala hantulu, niifwodi, ni kanji, nichikovwelu chahewulu chamaasamaasa, ninkuku, nimuya wamumbanda; diyi yuma yakuvwala yajila yakachiminawu nimanakweyi Aroni ni anyanindi amayala, kulonda yena akankalakeli mudimu wawupristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akatambuli niwuru, niwuzeeli, niwusombu, niwanda wuchinana nge, niwanda wawuwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifwodi akayituŋa nawuru, nawuzeeli, nawusombu, nawanda wuchinana nge, nawanda wawuwahi wakushinta, yakwila kudi muntu wukweti wukalawenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dakekali namahina akumafwiji ayedi akunuŋila kunsa jiyedi jefwodi, kulonda dakanuŋewi hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuya wakutuŋa nawukalawenu, wudi kwifwodi, wakuyikasa nachu, wakekali wakutuŋila mwomumu, wehina dodimu, wakekali wawuru, nawuzeeli, nawusombu, nawanda wuchinana nge, nawanda wawuwahiwakushinta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanoni malola atushohama ayedi, wakabazuhu majina awanyana kaIsarela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "majinawu atanu nadimu helola dimu, majina anashaluku atanu nadimu helola di kwawu, mwomwavwalikililuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabazi malolawa muyayedi wawu, mwomwekala majina awanyana kaIsarela, wakabazi mwomwakoŋelaŋayi mukwakubaza malola, mwomwabazilaŋawu ilola dachinjikijilu; wakayipati muwupatilu wawuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malolawa ayedi wakayishi hamahina akumafwiji akwifwodi, kulonda ekali malola akwanukisha nachu anyana kaIsarela; Aroni akasendi majinawu hamafwiji indi ejima ayedi kumesu aYehova, kulonda kwanukisha nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wake liyakupatila yawuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimaleŋi ayedi awuru wakoseka to-o, wakayili neyinyonji, yakushinta yakushinta, ana maleŋi akushinta wakayishi hayuma yakupatila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakeli nichibwiku chakusompesha chakuvwala hantulu, chakwila kudi muntu wukweti wukalawenu; wakachituŋa mwomuna mwakatuŋilawu ifwodi, wakachituŋa chawuru, nawuzeeli, nawusombu, nawanda wuchinanange, nawanda wawuwahi wakushinta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakekali nambaŋu jiwana, chakuvuŋa, mukuleha kwachu muchikasa chakusamanesha, mukutohakwachu muchikasa chakusamanesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakashumu wupatilu watumalola, nyi kana yiwana yatumalola, kumukana wumu dasaridini, nidantopaza, nidakeji keji, dimu mwakekala mukana wakusambila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kumukana wamuchiyedi kwakayi daemeraladi, nidakasafira, nidakayahalu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kumukanawa muchisatu kwakayi dailishemi, nidaishebu, nidakachelama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kumukanawa muchiwana kwakayi dakatarishi, nidakashohama, nidanja siperi, akayipati muwuru mwomwakuyipatila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malolawa akekali mwomwekalila majina awanyana kaIsarela, ikumi nayedi, mwomwekalila majinawu; akayibazi mwomwabazilaŋawu ilola dachinjikijilu, akekali anyichidi ikumi nayiyedi, mwomwekalila majinawu, iwu nejina dawu, iwu nejina dawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibwiku chakuvwala hantulu wakachichilili maleŋi ayedi neyi nyonji, yakushinta yakushinta yawuru wakoseka to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibwiku chakuvwala hantuluwaka chichilili nituzeya twawuru tuyedi, tuzeya tuna tuyedi wakatushi kunsajiyedi jachibwiku chakuvwala hantulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maleŋi ayedi akushinta awuruwakayishi namutuzeya tuna tuyedi kunsa jachibwiku chakuvwala hantulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Insa jikwawu jiyedi hamaleŋi ayedi akushinta wakajinuŋi kuyuma yiyedi yakupatila malola, wakayishi hamahina akumafwiji akwifwodi kumbidi yayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakeli tuzeya twawuru tuyedi, wakatushi kunsa jiyedi jachibwiku chakuvwala hantulu kumbavu yachu, kumbadi yefwodi yamukachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakeli nawa tuzeya tuyedi twawuru nawa, wakatunuŋili kwishina damahina akumafwiji akwifwodi kumbidi yayu, kwakwihi nakwakudinuŋa, hewulu damuya wefwodi wakutuŋa nawukalawenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukasa chibwiku chakuvwala hantulu akaleti tuzeya twakuchibwiku, akaleti tuzeya twakwifwodi, akatu kasili hamu namwonji wawuzeeli, kulonda chakekali hamuyawa kwifwodi wakutuŋa nawukalawenu, kulonda chibwiku chakuvwala hantulu chakabuli kusubuka kwifwodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni, hakeŋila ŋayi mwajila, wakasendaŋa hamuchima windi majina awanyana kaIsarela muchibwi kuchakusompesha chakuvwala hantulu, kulonda kwanukisha nachu kumesu aYehova mafuku ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchibwiku chakusompesha chakuvwala hantulu wakashilumu niWurimi niTumimi, twakekalaŋa hamuchima waAroni, hakeŋilaŋayi kumesu aYehova; Aroni wakasendaŋa hamuchima windi kumesu aYehova hefuku hefuku kusompesha kwakasompeshawu anyana kaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
