          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanji yefwodi wakachima yejima yawuzeeli hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakachi kayuhakekali hakulokola mwakuhichila namutu; kwakayilokwelawu akachi machimuku munuku kwi-ndo, kulonda yibuli kutabuka, neyi chachiminaŋa wuhalokolawu chi kovwelu chatuyi kuŋu chakunjita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumukundulu wayuwakeliluku ibula dimu dimu, mudi dawuzeeli, mudi dawusombu, mudidichinana nge, chochina hohu kwi-ndo, akasowashani nampwembu jawuru kwi-ndo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakeli mudi lupwambu lwawuru mudi ibula, mudi lupwambulwawuru mudi ibula, kumukundulu wakanji kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakekali hamujimba waAroni kulonda kukalakala nachu; jakavumaŋa, ngeli, ngeli, nichakeŋila ŋayi mwajila kumesu aYehova, nichakedi kaŋayi, kulonda akabuli kufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakeli cheŋa chawuru wakoseka to-o, wakabazuhu, neyi chabazaŋa wulola dachinjikijilu, neyi, Wajila Wayehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakachishi hakamwonjika wuze-eli, chakekali hankuku, hohambidi yankuku hohichakekala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakekali hehama daAroni, Aroni akasendi kuluwa kwayuma yajilayakajili kawu anyana kaIsarela muyamukunkulu yawu yajila yejima; chakekali hehama dindi mafuku ejima, kulonda akayitiyi kuwaha kudi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
