          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nianyana kaAroni amayala wakayichimini yi kovwelu, wakayituŋalininyiya, nimabonye, kulonda kulema nalubanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakavwiki nachu manakweyi Aroni, nawanyanindi hamu. Wakayiwayishi manji nakuyikunjika kumudimu nakuyijilika, kulonda akankalakeli mudimu wawupristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayichimini tuputula twamahina amawahi, twakuyibuta nachu abuli kwikala nzekesi, twakafumi hambunda nakushika nikumatafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni nawanya nindi amayala akatuvwalaŋa hakeŋilaŋawu mwitenti dakubulakena, hela hakashikaŋawu kwakwihi nakameŋa kulonda akakalakali mudimu mwajila; kulonda akabuli kusenda kuluwa, akabuli kufwa; chakekalihichidika chahaya nyaka chayena nawanyanindi amba kamulondelaŋaha nyima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.43"
            ]
          }
        }
